<title>UK: Argos sees low UK retail growth, warns on H1.</title>
<headline>Argos sees low UK retail growth, warns on H1.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>British retailer Argos Plc said on Monday it saw low growth in the country's retail sector for the rest of the decade. The store group also warned that higher costs in the first half of 1997 would make it difficult to improve on last year's record first half.</p>
</text>
